174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Step into the world of rhythm and movement with our engaging Dance Classes! These 50-minute sessions are designed for students of all skill levels to explore various dance styles, including jazz, hip-hop, contemporary, and musical theatre. Each class focuses on developing fundamental dance techniques, improving flexibility, coordination, and strength, while fostering creativity and self-expression. Students will learn dynamic choreography and performance skills, all within a supportive and energetic environment. With an emphasis on fun and teamwork, our dance classes provide the perfect opportunity to build confidence, make friends, and discover the joy of dance. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced dancer, there's a place for everyone to shine!)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Vocal Lessons)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Discover the power of your voice in our Vocal Lessons, tailored for singers of all levels, from beginners to advanced performers. These focused sessions are designed to develop vocal technique, including breath control, pitch accuracy, tone quality, and range expansion, while fostering confidence and self-expression. Students will explore a variety of musical styles, from pop and classical to musical theatre, with personalised guidance to suit their individual goals and interests. Emphasis is placed on vocal health, performance skills, and storytelling through song, creating a well-rounded and dynamic learning experience. Whether preparing for auditions, performances, or simply singing for fun, our vocal lessons provide the perfect opportunity to unlock your full potential and shine!)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
